  react/app/layout.tsx.j2 - Next.js App Router root layout.

  Rendered by: /new-project P5 (_frontend_react) →
    frontend/src/app/layout.tsx

  Variables used:
    - project_name, project_display_name, project_description
    - has_ai

  D-546: App Router. This file stays a SERVER component (it exports `metadata`),
  so every client-side provider is composed inside `<AppProviders>`.
  D-547: React Query provider lives in AppProviders (client boundary).
